(text "BQ29700 / common-drain back-to-back N-MOSFETs" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8517cace-b05e-569e-8e5d-cbaff33f1df4"))
(text "Cell + is PACK+ electrically; protection interrupts the negative conductor.\nNo system copper, test equipment ground, charger or load may connect to CELL_N.\nDefault raw-cell build: U301, Q301, Q302 populated; R303 OPEN / DNP." (at 20 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "de7de9b7-bd16-57e8-8a31-466144a0e104"))
(text "Population interlock" (at 260 72 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e1023ac-66ab-5ca4-88a8-4aa819854e3a"))
(text "RAW CELL: populate PROTECT group; R303 DNP.\nPROTECTED PACK: R303=0R; PROTECT group DNP.\nNever use R303 with an unprotected cell.\nThe only bypass connects CELL- to PACK-.\nIt cannot short PACK+ to PACK-." (at 260 78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "53eda329-2df4-518f-adc6-02f80f79fe11"))
(text "MOSFET selection change" (at 260 132 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8ebb785a-f170-5220-a1c7-3935f63421a7"))
(text "AO3400A replaces CSD16301Q2.\nSpecified Rds(on) <=48mOhm at Vgs=2.5V.\nCSD16301Q2 only specifies on-resistance\nat 4.5V; low-cell operation needs margin.\n2 FETs: <=96mOhm at 25C; 300mA ->\n28.8mV and 8.64mW total (excludes traces)." (at 260 138 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e9dca2f2-0333-51d5-978e-54b5e30d59c7"))
(text "Independent hardware protection" (at 25 228 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f57399a7-fffe-57e5-8d88-1d6e55084a82"))
(text "BQ29700: OVP 4.275 V; UVP 2.800 V; overcurrent +/-100mV nominal.\nKelvin-route VSS and V- to cell-side / pack-side source pads.\nSystem operating floor 3.0 V; reserve headroom for burst droop and protection tolerance.\nBring-up: verify body-diode orientation and protection release before attaching a cell." (at 25 234 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cba15084-78c8-543a-99b8-2e0ed179fb00"))
